{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/982725-need-help-coming-up-with-a-dark-aspiration-for-a-players-character","id":982725,"title":"Need help coming up with a 'dark' aspiration for a players character.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-06T09:02:11-07:00","id":982725,"title":"Need help coming up with a 'dark' aspiration for a players character.","content":"So I started to try something in order to highlight the constant presence of the beast (beyond the risk of frenzy). I give to each player an additionnal aspiration that would be innimical to their humanity. The concept is this is what their beasts want. Now i decided the first aspirations but i plan to have them cycle into the players decision. (meaning they choose the next aspiration or they can choose to change the aspiration at any time). That way they can develop a better understanding of the presence of their beast and how that would influence their decisions. Now i don't have any mechanic to make the players more likely to act on this aspiration as i think it is sufficient only to give the player the awareness of these dark urges and i leave to them to decide whether to act on it or not.<br /> <br /> So far i've got, for the wealthy gangrel character i've given the dark aspiration to ''physically hunt someone'', the criminal ventrue to ''Dominate a member of her mortal family'' and the singer daeva of the circle of the crone to ''create a cult venerating her''. <br /> But i'm drawing a blank on what to give to one of the characters. He is a occult investigator who was once with the police and was embraced into the mekhet clan when he learned to much about the occult. <br /> So what kind of humanity risking aspiration would fit with that character in your opinions?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-06T09:48:45-07:00","id":982752,"title":"","content":"Try to sacrifice someone in exchange for occult power.<br /> <br /> Driving him to maybe become a serial killer and the antithesis of what he once was.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2746-tgueiros","name":"TGUEIROS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2746_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-06T09:50:26-07:00","id":982755,"title":"","content":"Very <i>Wraith: Oblivion</i> shadow-esque temptation towards dissolution of the soul, I like it.<br /> <br /> &quot;Play vigilante by devouring dangerous human criminals and cultists whom evade human authorities.&quot;<br /> <br /> All too easy to self-justify, yet self-justification of horrible inhumane acts doesn't protect from Humanity erosion. I mean instead of being a monster that devours a subcategory of the wick, he could use mortal contacts to bring them to actual justice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>\u201cYouth ages, immaturity is outgrown, ignorance can be educated, and drunkenness sobered, but stupid lasts forever.\u201d </i>~ <b>Aristophanes</b><br /> <i>&quot;Virescit Vulnere Virtus&quot;</i> ~ <b>Stewart Clan Motto</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Frailty Chronicles</a></span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">;</a><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding the power of limitations.</a></b></div>","edited":{"userid":3279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","user":"Pale_Crusader","date":". 10-06-2016, 01:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","name":"Pale_Crusader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-06T09:58:59-07:00","id":982760,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TGUEIROS</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/982725-need-help-coming-up-with-a-dark-aspiration-for-a-players-character?p=982752#post982752\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Try to sacrifice someone in exchange for occult power.<br /> <br /> Driving him to maybe become a serial killer and the antithesis of what he once was.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wow my brain went straight there too.<br /> <br /> Perhaps eschew humanity all together. Humanity is the mundane his desire is directly opposed to. <br /> <br /> You could end up throwing a lot of beats at him. But perhaps when he finds a way to influence humans without interacting with them. Going without human contact is one of those things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1117-overload","name":"overload","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1117_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-06T10:11:01-07:00","id":982769,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>overload</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/982725-need-help-coming-up-with-a-dark-aspiration-for-a-players-character?p=982760#post982760\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Wow my brain went straight there too.<br /> <br /> Perhaps eschew humanity all together. Humanity is the mundane his desire is directly opposed to.<br /> <br /> You could end up throwing a lot of beats at him. But perhaps when he finds a way to influence humans without interacting with them. Going without human contact is one of those things.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think your onto something here. Instead of foregoing human contact entirely maybe start with something softer.<br /> I'm thinking of going with '' To die'' not in the sense of destruction but in the sense that the character still possess his mortal identity. <br /> After being fired from the police he opened up a detective agency and he currently has for aspiration to have his agency become more important and he likes being the head detective so to speak so it's gonna be tricky to frame the 'dark' aspiration as something tempting. But it is workable.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-06T17:23:28-07:00","id":983021,"title":"","content":"Sounds interesting. I really like the dark aspirations thing. I was planning on running a game using the aspiration twist from the storyteller section. <br /> <br /> Adding in dark aspirations may be something I consider as well. Really wanted to focus more on the players desires than a concrete metaplot. <br /> <br /> Would be awesome to add that twist of self destructive in as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1117-overload","name":"overload","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1117_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-06T19:02:48-07:00","id":983070,"title":"","content":"I really like this idea. Stealing it.<br /> <br /> \u200bAlso, for your Mekhet, maybe an aspiration that plays up the unseen, shadowy aspect of the clan: \u200bLearn a dirty secret about someone and use it to ruin them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1257-kerensky","name":"Kerensky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1257_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-07T13:56:45-07:00","id":983516,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kerensky</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/982725-need-help-coming-up-with-a-dark-aspiration-for-a-players-character?p=983070#post983070\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u200bAlso, for your Mekhet, maybe an aspiration that plays up the unseen, shadowy aspect of the clan: \u200bLearn a dirty secret about someone and use it to ruin them.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I really like that. perhaps starting with 'death of your mortal identity' would be to harsh at first. Instead 'learn someones dark secrets and use it to blackmail them while never being identified' could work better with where the character is standing right now.<br /> <br /> Something occur to me that i dont know how one goes about creating a cult (not in the fluff sense but in the mechanic sense). I know there is the 'mystery cult initiation' merit but does that work for the founder and leader of the cult or would that be something else???","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-07T14:37:53-07:00","id":983538,"title":"","content":"<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6261-mailanka\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"6261\" data-vbnamecard=\"6261\">Mailanka</a><br /> <br /> Why just one Dark Aspiration per character? I am not suggesting multiple Aspirations at once, but rather a progression increasingly dark aspirations like a trail of bread crumbs that lead to the chrysalis of the Beast into a Strix, or whatever style of struggle-against-Damnation story you are telling.<br /> <br /> Start with low hanging fruit, make it sweet even a full XP per Dark Aspiration fullfilled. then crank up the horribleness, slowly at first then quickly.<br /> <br /> The paths i could foresee are like this<br /> <br /> <br /> the wealthy gangrel character <ol class=\"decimal\"><li>&quot;Break something in frustration&quot;</li> <li>&quot;Use the destruction of property to intimidate others&quot;</li> <li>''Physically hunt someone that hurt you''</li> <li>&quot;Kill someone that that hurt you.&quot;</li> <li>&quot;Devour those that would dare threaten you&quot;</li> </ol><br /> <br /> the criminal ventrue <ol class=\"decimal\"><li>&quot;Demand respect from your family&quot;</li> <li>&quot;Punish those that threaten your family&quot;</li> <li>''Dominate a member of her mortal family''</li> <li>&quot;Kill those that threaten to take control of your family away from you&quot;</li> <li>&quot;Render your whole mortal family into puppets without will, their lineage kept as purebred pets&quot;</li> </ol><br /> <br /> the singer daeva of the circle of the crone <ol class=\"decimal\"><li>&quot;Get someone to love her&quot;</li> <li>&quot;Get her lover to accept her unfaithfulness&quot;</li> <li>''Create a polyamorous cult venerating her as a dark goddess'</li> <li>&quot;Lead your cult into debauched bloodbath/letting bacchanal&quot;</li> <li>&quot;Have your cult offer willing life-blood sacrifices to you&quot;</li> </ol><br /> <br /> the occult investigator mekhet <ol class=\"decimal\"><li>&quot;Discover the hidden and dangerous human cults preying upon humanity.&quot;</li> <li>&quot;Secretly stalk dangerous human cultists and criminals&quot;</li> <li>&quot;Forcefully pry dark secrets from dangerous human cultists and criminals&quot;</li> <li>&quot;Terrorize those humans that dare presume to terrorize the night&quot;</li> <li>&quot;Play dark vigilante by devouring dangerous human criminals and cultists whom evade human authorities&quot;</li> </ol><br /> <br /> keep the future Dark Aspirations secret until they've fulfilled, and thus progressed beyond the proceeding one.I strongly recommend having something awful at the bottom of the pit, like aforementioned strix &quot;birth&quot;, being righteously hunted by those with moral high ground, or transforming something terrible/unplayable.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>\u201cYouth ages, immaturity is outgrown, ignorance can be educated, and drunkenness sobered, but stupid lasts forever.\u201d </i>~ <b>Aristophanes</b><br /> <i>&quot;Virescit Vulnere Virtus&quot;</i> ~ <b>Stewart Clan Motto</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Frailty Chronicles</a></span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">;</a><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding the power of limitations.</a></b></div>","edited":{"userid":3279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","user":"Pale_Crusader","date":". 10-07-2016, 07:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","name":"Pale_Crusader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"841"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}